"""
Workflow 09 — Submission: precompute the metrics tables consumed by figures/paper.ipynb.

figures/paper.ipynb builds three figures (gene expression, splice site usage,
splice junctions), each requiring heavy groupby/merge/Pearson-r computation
over the raw prediction parquets from workflow 06 (AlphaGenome) and workflow 08
(Pangolin) -- most expensive being the junction dedup (~112M rows per run).
This workflow runs that work once and writes compact long-format parquets to
results/paper/, so the notebook only has to read three small files and plot.

Run with:
    snakemake -s workflows/09-submission/Snakefile --use-conda [-n]
"""

